F BrushSpecification::Resolve                   | Api/BrushSpecification.h         | 293       | Resolves the brush's parameters at one impression of one stroke. and the sequence `22` resolves with are the same sequence. One that disagreed would give a preview whose variation is not the variation the artist gets. paint nothing on a mouse and a tilt brush behave as though every stylus were flat.
