T TilingSpecification                           | Api/TilingSpecification.h        | 144-210   | One repeating pattern — a lattice, an ordered run of cell content, and how cells vary. content placed in one cell of it, and none of them is noise. The mechanism is periodic and deterministic, and saying so first is the point: pattern generation reaches for noise by habit.
